Meta.documentation:Boolean.if
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Routes the flow: then for true, else for false.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:For each incoming Boolean, fires the then output when it is true, the else
Meta.documentation:output when it is false. Downstream resources bound to those outputs are
Meta.documentation:triggered.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — the condition
Meta.documentation:@port out_go_then — fired when the condition is true
Meta.documentation:@port out_go_else — fired when the condition is false
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Boolean:true>>Boolean.if:>>String:Yes>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:Yes
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental
Meta.documentation:

